    "q-122928": {
      "dom_id": "step-q122928",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "A curve is defined by the parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=4\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,y=2t\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,0<t<\\infty .\n$$\n\nLet $C$ be the point that corresponds to $t=e$ on the curve. Find the equation of the normal to the curve at $C.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we find the coordinates of the point $C$ by substituting $t=e$ into the parametric equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡e=4, \\\\ y & =2e\\operatorname{ln}⁡e=2e\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we're looking to find the equation of the tangent line to the curve at the point $(4,2e).$ For this, we need to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ which means we first need to find the derivatives of $x$ and $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{4}{t},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+2\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+2}{(\\frac{4}{t})} \\\\  & =\\frac{t\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+t}{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=e,$ the slope of the tangent line is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={\\frac{dy}{dx}|}_{t=e} & =\\frac{e\\operatorname{ln}⁡e+e}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{e+e}{2}=e\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the slope ${m}_{n}$ of the normal line, we take the negative reciprocal of $m$:\n\n$$\n{m}_{n}=-\\frac{1}{m}=-\\frac{1}{\\,e\\,}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the equation of the normal, we use point-slope form with the point $({x}_{1},{y}_{1})=(4,2e)$ and the slope ${m}_{n}=-\\frac{1}{\\,e\\,}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-2e & =(-\\frac{1}{\\,e\\,})(x-4) \\\\ y-2e & =-\\frac{1}{\\,e\\,}x+\\frac{4}{\\,e\\,} \\\\ y & =-\\frac{1}{\\,e\\,}x+\\frac{2{e}^{2}+4}{\\,e\\,}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-122928-a",
              "type": "math",
